    {"key": 'what_is_veye', "category": 'About Veye', "title": 'What is Veye?', "body": 'Veye programs help members manage disease, lose weight and take a proactive role in their own healthcare. Veye takes a nutritional approach to family health. Whether challenged by diabetes, heart disease, osteoporosis, infertility, asthma or the simple desire to improve quality of life, Veye will be there to offer detailed nutritional planning and day-to-day support. Veye makes it possible to put medical advice into action.', "display_order": 1},
