    {"key": 'a_page_will_not_load_or_looks_broken', "category": 'Technical Issues', "title": 'A page will not load or looks broken', "body": 'Refresh the page first. If that does not help, clear your browser cache and reload. A stale cached file is the most common cause of a page rendering incorrectly.', "display_order": 7},
    {"key": 'what_is_metabolism', "category": 'Diet and Nutrition Terminology', "title": 'What is metabolism?', "body": 'Your metabolism is how you process and convert energy, and is controlled by AMPK. Metabolism controls your weight, mental focus, physical performance, how you age, and more. By following the Veye program you can control AMPK, and therefore your metabolism.', "display_order": 8},
    {"key": 'is_intermittent_fasting_good_for_you', "category": 'Diet and Nutrition Terminology', "title": 'Is intermittent fasting good for you?', "body": 'Although intermittent fasting has shown promise in reducing senescent, or “zombie” cells, you can achieve the same effect without starving by eating a low calorie diet with the proper ratio of macronutrients. The Veye program restricts calories without sacrifice.', "display_order": 9},
    {"key": 'why_do_i_need_to_eat_protein_at_every_meal', "category": 'Diet and Nutrition Terminology', "title": 'Why do I need to eat protein at every meal?', "body": 'To activate glucagon and AMPK, two important components to health.', "display_order": 10},
    {"key": 'how_much_protein_do_i_need', "category": 'Diet and Nutrition Terminology', "title": 'How much protein do I need?', "body": 'Most women need 77grams per day and men 121grams, although this varies by the individual. The Veye program can help you determine your exact protein needs.', "display_order": 11},
    {"key": 'how_is_veye_different_from_other_diet_programs', "category": 'About Veye', "title": 'How is Veye different from other diet programs?', "body": 'Veye goes far beyond what diet sites such as WW (Weight Watchers), Noom and Jenny Craig offer, and beyond what most nutritionists offer. Veye’s proprietary systems are about more than weight loss — they are about improved health. The Veye nutritional program is based on peer reviewed and published Medical research. Veye maintains relationships with medical organizations, cutting edge thinkers, and sole practitioners.', "display_order": 12},
    {"key": 'what_is_in_my_account', "category": 'Subscription and My Account', "title": 'What is in My Account?', "body": 'To recover your account, go to the sign in section, enter your email and reset your password.', "display_order": 13},
    {"key": 'how_do_i_set_up_my_meals', "category": 'Using the Platform', "title": 'How do I set up my meals?', "body": 'Then make your food choices — this will help the Veye Companion customize your meals. After you have chosen the foods you like to eat, go to Your Days and the Veye Companion will help you create meals that work around your lifestyle, not the other way around. Before you start, the Veye Companion will give you the opportunity to explore the science behind our program.', "display_order": 14},
    {"key": 'what_should_i_do_every_day', "category": 'Using the Platform', "title": 'What should I do every day?', "body": 'Finally, fill out the food diary as often as possible. The Veye Companion will assess your choices and let you know what meals are perfect for you, and what can be improved.', "display_order": 15},
    {"key": 'my_progress_does_not_seem_to_be_saving', "category": 'Technical Issues', "title": 'My progress does not seem to be saving', "body": 'Make sure you press Save on the screen you are filling in, and that your browser is not in private/incognito mode, which discards stored progress when the window closes.', "display_order": 16},
