    {"key": 'my_issue_is_still_not_fixed', "category": 'Technical Issues', "title": 'My issue is still not fixed', "body": 'Email help@veye.co with a short description of what happened and which page you were on, and we will take it from there.', "display_order": 18},
    {"key": 'what_is_the_key_to_living_longer', "category": 'Diet and Nutrition Terminology', "title": 'What is the key to living longer?', "body": 'Calorie restriction is the only known way to increase longevity. The Veye program allows calorie restriction without hunger or deprivation.', "display_order": 19},
    {"key": 'is_a_vegan_diet_the_best_one', "category": 'Diet and Nutrition Terminology', "title": 'Is a vegan diet the best one?', "body": 'The research is inconclusive, although Veye respects individuals who choose this lifestyle. It is hard to get adequate protein on a vegan diet. Veye can help you maintain a vegan diet, or make healthy choices whatever your dietary preference is.', "display_order": 20},
